f]--&gt;&lt;img alt="" src="https://assets.bwbx.io/images/users/iqjWHBFdfxIU/iaDAATEcc1Vo/v0/-1x-1.jpg" style="width: 100%; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px;" /&gt;&lt;!--[if mso]&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;![endif]--&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4;"&gt;朝鲜哨所旁的巨型扬声器。&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; font-style: italic;"&gt;摄影师：Jung Yeon-je/法新社/盖蒂图片社&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;阿根廷债券的暴跌&lt;/strong&gt;让看涨的投资者感到意外，因为全球新兴市场的回调&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/RuRVloyQR2Xhf_8znyPn6N25t2pSKkMhuScmBTAjMdswKONi_K1JL1jdvvBOKRAH3eFbe2g50PXBecqOyc1NChY8RPKSKtgJ5cNh_lpbnsUdxSVXdOOwlbEa1gLFSOXVzNtIVreR24RGpbUgXvsf8FZi638WUOt-KQxVXhyrkJnxbsuqUmwlJoJ0KgJTwm6xzYgzEg_KJgNeCAn3s9tt9H58SumfJfI0bVVu38YNdeHs7SUR7GxvXjrxVoDK9QJzKqe3w9hFZ8uLrm6HN-CRw9hcR5pE2SimsvONofHKG9SedIy1RUk-re0F4MlFXBS1MAdQ6UOHQvc83x2O-VvVQX2uaEBU9DqSv-U2CgMbGyeJGp9DFqC6X138RZdAG5aRNPOQrH7omWYpPYYMlfVfHA5D860gWQ3YAt2svylgDVW7eJhtLo8Xd8z4CaeTeLknCW9TeVi7g1avyykBQeSlAn2gAlAMm1sSaunRKJ2KpOrC5MzQE9R-FvgHUrHBPkODPcgWl8rLbWIfB-Ifmfn3y_sGBgnx_bNdE_FwGFolZaTQLRc/K9fZXtGQIXJyBsPN4fTM5ynxYqe3DiWx/25" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="随着投票担忧加剧，阿根廷债券抛售令多头措手不及"&gt;加剧了人们对总统哈维尔·米莱连任前景和偿还数十亿美元债务的能力的担忧&lt;/a&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt; &lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/HjNpZKhFT5BEE1zBBaVp5x76sDMIuNxMDFOkubwzHvwydPXQp5z4l3fuJ_D8oifCpUiCsD3BscQPrp7zllyhGn_9Wx3GR14Z6z22Fh0lWKVxFjJEwFOCFtJg-UyAvLZ8G0hWTpp6Iu7l8tiLa4I7i18Rr7q4jHKbYr8qCEZk4jWRkv3SvRIKVkRdIBUrV-m73ug_6s5qptcsA81xojchFcSm8DakduXdJv3xHILRnE2MSYezi0lnS1NGsonkccx3BK_AhO-CIRBheY_EV7w-Kn3nBNYeBFFhDSNvpRD00XReGg3djIG6JiER4DqGYrwRwjiuo4aJNWlSBeDLPHk5BkBc_tFCDOICTGvEKzgl9JJjrWZfh-uYWOeiNDmiuXaIYbOAUj806xCFI_vzud7Djyjj12ObqF0SPvDpQ_0KJci01PDKAOjU22_c3GITUV-kHrk8JgHUBT59QHjEmAon1xpebPLax