ze: 16px;"&gt;战斗还远没有结束。 10 月 15 日，12 名共和党州检察长&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/s/c/K66gqIhGs-vbt8fUNUYvnsEw3aWvIVvda9LKHLXqq7R2QLqDYD_qcOZcsiGBxe7Kpy47vweOK-EruRecj3JnItfG8wpExmIvkNL57XxAFXDhlBTHbuIkLwGOVfCfAqG_1aW0du7dKZ7jFnwsnFA26dgvJzBJzGMU9-pQrFVkj-KoDGM3BQhwSsf_dW5TLVV3dp8Dpxl6KNBdd-uZrkjcQf_HVG1Fdde4iV55e-63zIsSKbbHs7uML8TYmHMRy9-tsz2QITYl_wWZBUVxNh16oPHmeE-4glXO-XqB2KPxX5T0uv1EmmIoJrx8LNAU6e44EOCYlQ9_878RSzT1fEoBJ9jrS0RZ8of0kxCv-aE7EseqRnhZfd2pHVU7Bl-E7ivvGkgwXB3-KaCuUL8TgCSB/meC5aYmw9ejlSE5kY_9HhRYNjsPyZstz/25" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="司法部长麦卡斯基领导联盟支持管道批准，以保持天然气输送和能源就业保障"&gt;请求&lt;/a&gt;联邦监管机构允许修建 Oracle 为其数据中心供电所需的天然气管道。甲骨文已寻求&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/s/c/mOPWpRZdhT4KTQ1vqJt26bNVPzhaoNbHhKh0KTbccBvhy_WHTx2LiPHTM9Teecy4hscS33HZXMYEMpzGmX8aA4wIloR9dwsWlATE8Auv390t6LCeceEJEl5DeIPHhR1f9b8BSQMn8n1RwTCKgIBRNUF9DZwDKQjmCAeyIIEGzGwV05OdMW6hkAvHk4MAU_KNWbhbT8SpI1ydf9dPB8BKL4rrUMPSDBGxGNc8YdOrRcM-y4wsPMA_WujXywakpKx552CfggylfWAcgff-V76a7BtyxhSTWSpvtuS3XYN2yUQfUYmPV1Y_9qUTno-PQSfjBMzEp_ZcUWVhPeE4dqxP9yVcqlpvBQz6_exNFsuxQJw1AykewSUflcsPoa4IcRo6NM7583rEfoPt-ZoMEn6nIJmDqp5HVN3D6UQrPvbgu847r27OY3MKUvQ3VsGSHTNgEWLkNBnVVt4h6hLPPTAFvSH390dFsIeCSJ8oo78/M4kzDLpFmd4xOeLffxE-u6wQKWC7nntS/25" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="搜索"&gt;调整&lt;/a&gt;其方法来解决环境问题。但纳纳西表示，她所代表的活动人士将继续战斗，直到甲骨文被迫“步行”。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;该公司的挫折在市场上引起了反响。上个月，有消息称甲骨文在寻求应对许可障碍的影响时&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/WMfIdvXpkdoePhnx5kkDJFrJv32-oGjPuoXfYk2LZkCC9mNkT6E54ECjgS_NboqjekT0zHNIuYV01MiHyS1p4gSt00W-SMu1d26nzhPSLOgrns1-yBU_vBx0vhzFwxWiBXFZAs3Pok1zJKmBG7U_AEpcq-P5unTz0YJLgvKJpr9VOhhp0NbqXTNxMPQfUxcFBp6Sf7V-U5ttyseYoM3zEVjURlUPFfqlSJ_7l1DsA62pI79kUDiykMpMzaEBbR0jeBbHiLDG9583NOecv4hHZPHeEARtMuUWV8GO9s0Erk2cbfoI7tu4F_lAtPOUaM-if93nB3euJD1x7F-IWHsKPCwKbzG8sPHyH7_IBiSHshgUs227YJPpbPaGQZFF-VbL9T_w195XB